---
/**
 * The app has no window to screenshot, so the page shows the three moments it
 * actually has: the menu, the calibration, the nudge. Drawn as wireframes in
 * the page's own tokens rather than doctored screenshots, so they never lie
 * about a pixel and never go stale.
 */
---

<section class="ps-screen border-t border-line" id="ps-app">
  <div class="ps-shell">
    <p class="ps-kicker">Inside the app</p>

    <h2 class="mt-4 max-w-[24ch] text-[clamp(1.9rem,4.2vw,2.9rem)]">
      There is no app window. That is the point.
    </h2>

    <p class="mt-6 max-w-[58ch] text-[1.08rem] text-muted">
      Posture is a square in the menu bar and, rarely, one notification.
      Everything it has to say fits in these three moments.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <!-- 1 · the menu -->
      <figure class="m-0">
        <div
          class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-raised shadow-float"
        >
          <div
            class="flex items-center justify-end gap-3 border-b border-line bg-sunk px-4 py-2"
          >
            <span class="h-2.5 w-8 rounded-sm bg-line"></span>
            <span class="h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
            <span
              class="grid h-5 w-5 place-items-center rounded-[5px] border-2 border-ink"
              aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span class="h-2.5 w-10 rounded-sm bg-line"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="px-5 py-4 text-[0.92rem]">
            <p class="flex items-center justify-between font-medium text-ink">
              Good posture
              <svg
                class="h-4 w-4 text-accent"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                stroke-width="3"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12.5l5.2 5.2L20 7"></path></svg
              >
            </p>
            <div class="my-3 border-t border-line"></div>
            <p class="py-1 text-muted">Recalibrate</p>
            <p class="py-1 text-muted">Pause for an hour</p>
            <p class="py-1 text-muted">Quit Posture</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="mt-4 text-[0.9rem] text-muted">
          <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">The menu.</strong> One verdict, three
          actions. Nothing else to manage.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <!-- 2 · calibration -->
      <figure class="m-0">
        <div
          class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-raised shadow-float"
        >
          <div class="px-5 pt-5 pb-4">
            <p
              class="flex items-center gap-2 text-[0.92rem] font-medium text-ink"
            >
              <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
              Calibrating 6/10, hold still
            </p>
            <div class="mt-4 flex gap-1.5" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
              <span class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
              <span class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
              <span class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
              <span class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
              <span class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-accent"></span>
              <span class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
              <span class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
              <span class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
              <span class="h-1.5 flex-1 rounded-full bg-line"></span>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-4 text-[0.88rem] text-muted">
              Sit the way you actually want to sit. Ten samples become your
              baseline: a few numbers, never an image.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="mt-4 text-[0.9rem] text-muted">
          <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Calibration.</strong> Once, about
          ten seconds, redo it whenever your setup changes.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>

      <!-- 3 · the nudge -->
      <figure class="m-0">
        <div
          class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-line bg-raised shadow-float"
        >
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3.5 px-5 py-5">
            <span
              class="mt-0.5 grid h-9 w-9 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-[9px] bg-ink"
              aria-hidden="true"
            >
              <span class="h-4 w-4 rounded-[4px] border-2 border-accent"></span>
            </span>
            <div class="text-[0.92rem]">
              <p class="font-semibold text-ink">Posture</p>
              <p class="mt-0.5 text-muted">
                You have been slouching for a while. Sit up.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption class="mt-4 text-[0.9rem] text-muted">
          <strong class="font-semibold text-ink">The nudge.</strong> Arrives after
          sustained drift, not on a timer. Then it shuts up.
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
